WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:03.303
Tonight, we are getting a new window

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.337
into former President

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:04.871
Donald Trump's

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.339
willingness to associate

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.308
with highly controversial figures.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:08.775
Just days

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.710
after he announced his 2024 run

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.911
for the White House.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:12.645
Let's bring in CNN

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:13.646
national political reporter,

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.581
me of Reston.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:15.582
May we have

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:18.752
Trump hosting rapper Kanye West or Jay

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:19.652
at Mar

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.820
a Lago down in Florida,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.523
as well as an outspoken Holocaust denier?

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.458
What more do we know about this dinner?

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.694
So this started bubbling up, Alex, on

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:32.699
social media when Yeh was was posting

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.401
about his meeting

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:36.269
with Donald Trump at Mar a Lago

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:37.137
this week.

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:38.938
He was spotted at an airport

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:39.939
walking through an airport

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:40.273
with Nick

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:41.608
Fuentes, who, as you

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:43.877
noted, is a Holocaust denier.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.912
He has been condemned by the

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:47.747
the Anti-Defamation League

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.916
for anti-Semitic comments.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.285
His white nationalist rhetoric.

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:55.655
But but Kanye basically put up a video

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.892
saying that the three of them

00:00:58.892 --> 00:00:59.826
had had dinner

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:02.128
along with others at Mar a Lago.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.964
And he claimed that

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:06.266
that Trump

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:09.002
had been impressed with Fuentes.

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:10.603
We saw the former

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.572
president push back on this today

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.908
on his truth social platform.

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.709
And I'll just read you what he said.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:17.911
He said this past week,

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:18.611
Kanye West

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.947
called me to have dinner at Mar a Lago.

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:22.415
Shortly thereafter,

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:23.917
he unexpectedly showed up

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.051
with three of his friends

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.719
whom I knew nothing about.

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:28.154
We had dinner on Tuesday

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:29.923
evening with many members

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.891
present on the back patio.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.960
The dinner was quick and uneventful.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.663
They then left for the airport and Trump

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.132
just a short time ago, also

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.501
posted again on Truth Social,

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:44.104
saying that essentially

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.505
that there were no

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:48.007
there was no antisemitism expressed

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:48.975
at this dinner

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:50.910
and adding that he didn't know

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.712
Nick Fuentes.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.881
But of course, we have seen this pattern

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:55.949
from the former president

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:58.485
before when he is associated

00:01:58.485 --> 00:01:59.953
with controversial figures,

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:02.555
he tries to distance himself from them.

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:03.990
And of course,

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.859
at the bottom of all of this,

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:06.993
he's hosting

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:07.660
a Kanye

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.729
West at Mar a Lago, his private club,

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:12.565
someone who has recently been engulfed

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.400
in controversy

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.603
over his own anti-Semitic remarks.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.671
So it's pretty hard to imagine

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:20.406
that the former president

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:22.242
missed all of that, Alex.

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:23.843
All right, Mave stay with us.

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.111
I want to bring in two others

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:25.945
to this discussion.

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:26.646
CNN senior

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:27.280
media reporter

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:27.981
Oliver Darcy

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:29.549
and our senior law enforcement

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.384
analyst, Andrew McCabe, the former

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.052
FBI deputy director.

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.421
Guys, thank you both for joining us.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:36.489
Oliver,

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:38.158
let's put aside for a second

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:40.126
the fact that apparently people

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:41.828
can just show up to dinner

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.996
with a former president

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.430
and he didn't know about it.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.899
But this isn't

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:47.534
Nick Fuentes isn't just anyone.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:49.802
He's a very well known white nationalist

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.371
Holocaust denier

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:54.107
to maybe point about a pattern.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:55.074
Do you think that Trump

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:56.976
is trying to have it both ways?

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.144
When he associates

00:02:58.144 --> 00:03:00.180
with people like Fuentes

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.247
and then kind of puts out

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:03.449
a half hearted apology?

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:03.816
Yeah,

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:05.885
I think it stretches credibility to say

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.588
that he didn't know who this was.

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:09.255
I mean, Nick

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:12.091
Fuentes is a pretty prominent individual

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.059
in the far right

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:14.794
fever swamp that Donald Trump

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:15.862
frequents these days.

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:16.462
And so

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:17.397
I find it hard

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:19.599
to believe that he or his advisers

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:20.900
didn't know ahead of time

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.468
that who this was.

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:23.903
And I also find it hard to believe

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:24.704
during dinner

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:26.573
that it didn't become quite clear

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:28.675
how radical Fuentes is.

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:30.810
I mean, this is a very vocal person

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.078
when it comes to expressing

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:33.913
extremist ideology.

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:34.180
You know,

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:34.881
he was out there

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:37.050
praising the Taliban for instance,

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.751
for taking over Afghanistan, saying

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:40.019
it was a positive development

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:40.420
in the world

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.588
because he finds

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:43.690
their Christian conservative

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:46.159
worldview to be something that to

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:47.327
aspire to. So

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:49.963
even if he didn't know who he was

00:03:49.963 --> 00:03:51.064
prior to dinner,

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:52.832
I'm sure he got a good sense

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:54.334
of who he was during dinner.

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:56.402
And take Kanye West

00:03:56.536 --> 00:03:57.237
with a grain of salt.

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.371
But Kanye West is out there

00:03:58.371 --> 00:03:59.839
saying that he was very impressed

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:01.107
with his views.

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:03.576
And, you know, outside of all of that,

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.411
he has one of these things right

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.914
he could get on through social right now

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:09.716
and condemn Nick Fuentes.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:10.416
Instead, he's

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:11.951
really just downplaying this dinner.

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:12.919
So I think that kind of says

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:13.553
it all, doesn't it?

00:04:13.553 --> 00:04:14.721
Yeah, and I should correct myself.

00:04:14.721 --> 00:04:15.755
It wasn't an apology.

00:04:15.755 --> 00:04:17.490
It was some sort of explanation.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:18.124
The former president

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:20.393
doesn't really apologize,

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.662
Andrew, in terms of the danger here.

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:24.030
How worrying is it,

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:24.731
do you think, that

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:25.732
the former president

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:27.300
is is really elevating

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.068
people like this when

00:04:29.068 --> 00:04:30.737
especially this threat of domestic

00:04:30.737 --> 00:04:32.672
violent extremism we know is so high

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.710
Well, you know, it's a great question.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.479
And I think you have to go back

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:40.046
a little bit

00:04:40.046 --> 00:04:41.147
to understand that

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:43.216
for decades in this country,

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:44.984
people who held and espoused

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:47.086
the sorts of views that Nick Fuentes does

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:47.987
kind of existed

00:04:47.987 --> 00:04:50.923
in a non-existent political backwater.

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:53.259
You couldn't go out publicly

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:54.327
and say these sorts of things.

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:54.594
I mean, you

00:04:54.594 --> 00:04:55.662
could you have the right to do that,

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:56.262
but you were pretty,

00:04:56.262 --> 00:04:58.398
pretty quickly denounced.

00:04:58.398 --> 00:04:59.899
The reason they're so prominent

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:02.068
now is because people like Donald Trump

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:03.536
and other political leaders

00:05:03.536 --> 00:05:04.504
in this country

00:05:04.504 --> 00:05:06.572
have done things like met

00:05:06.572 --> 00:05:07.707
with people like this

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:09.676
or responded to their invitations

00:05:09.676 --> 00:05:11.344
to speak at conferences

00:05:11.344 --> 00:05:13.546
or, you know, met with them

00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:15.148
and accepted them as dinner

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.282
guests in their home,

00:05:16.282 --> 00:05:18.084
the private club of Mar-A-Lago.

00:05:18.084 --> 00:05:21.287
Those sorts of actions validate

00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:23.189
these people and validate

00:05:23.189 --> 00:05:24.991
their views in a way

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:28.494
that allows this toxic spread to grow.

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:30.630
And this is what people like

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.365
Nick Fuentes thrive on.

00:05:32.365 --> 00:05:32.999
He needs

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:35.868
that sort of highly visible validation

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:36.969
and acceptance

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:37.870
by the absolute

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:38.571
highest level

00:05:38.571 --> 00:05:39.706
of political leadership

00:05:39.706 --> 00:05:40.239
in this case

00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:42.575
in the Republican Party anyway.

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:45.578
He uses that to engender new supporters,

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:46.512
new viewers,

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:49.315
new readers of his materials.

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:51.150
That's how they get their views

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.251
out to a wider audience.

00:05:52.251 --> 00:05:53.086
That's how they recruit

00:05:53.086 --> 00:05:54.520
more people and supporters.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.188
And that's

00:05:55.188 --> 00:05:57.156
why we're in a situation today

00:05:57.156 --> 00:05:59.492
where domestic extremist

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:01.294
violence is at levels

00:06:01.294 --> 00:06:02.829
we have never seen before.

00:06:02.829 --> 00:06:03.529
Because these things

00:06:03.529 --> 00:06:05.098
that used to be relegated

00:06:05.098 --> 00:06:06.199
to the backwaters

00:06:06.199 --> 00:06:08.501
are now accepted and discussed

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:10.837
right on on social media

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:12.338
and on regular media.

00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:13.272
By people like that.

00:06:13.272 --> 00:06:15.074
Yeah. It's just mainstreaming hate.

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:16.909
It's as simple as that.

00:06:16.909 --> 00:06:18.211
Oliver, at the same time,

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:19.545
we've got, you know, Twitter,

00:06:19.545 --> 00:06:20.012
of course,

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:21.381
taken over by Elon

00:06:21.381 --> 00:06:22.448
Musk more

00:06:22.448 --> 00:06:23.816
the far right

00:06:23.816 --> 00:06:25.551
voices have been allowed

00:06:25.551 --> 00:06:27.220
back onto the platform.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.055
What is the latest there?

00:06:29.055 --> 00:06:29.522
Yeah, well,

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:30.323
Nick, French

00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:31.991
fantasy is actually one of those people

00:06:31.991 --> 00:06:33.593
who's been banned from the platform

00:06:33.593 --> 00:06:35.094
and seemingly one of those people

00:06:35.094 --> 00:06:35.928
that would be covered

00:06:35.928 --> 00:06:36.562
under this

00:06:36.562 --> 00:06:37.597
general amnesty

00:06:37.597 --> 00:06:39.899
that Elon Musk says will occur next week

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:41.834
for people who haven't broken the law

00:06:41.834 --> 00:06:43.002
but who have been

00:06:43.002 --> 00:06:44.070
banned from the platform.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.272
So I think you might be seeing Twitter

00:06:46.272 --> 00:06:47.407
get a lot more chaotic.

00:06:47.407 --> 00:06:48.775
And you talk about

00:06:48.775 --> 00:06:49.909
people

00:06:49.942 --> 00:06:51.444
used to being confined

00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:53.413
to dark corners of the Web.

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:55.181
Twitter is a place, that platform,

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:55.982
some of those people,

00:06:55.982 --> 00:06:57.750
and they were eventually banned.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.551
But now it seems

00:06:58.551 --> 00:07:00.520
that Musk is going to allow them

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.788
back onto the platform

00:07:01.788 --> 00:07:02.622
and give them a voice.

00:07:02.622 --> 00:07:03.756
We only have a couple of moments left.

00:07:03.756 --> 00:07:05.057
But but Andrew, to you again

00:07:05.057 --> 00:07:06.893
about the potential dangers

00:07:06.893 --> 00:07:08.528
there of these types of people

00:07:08.528 --> 00:07:09.829
being on more on

00:07:09.829 --> 00:07:11.397
this more mainstream platform.

00:07:11.397 --> 00:07:12.665
How worried are you about these changes?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:14.434
You know,

00:07:14.434 --> 00:07:15.501
all of that, Alex

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:17.937
Cohen conveys that sort of legitimacy

00:07:17.937 --> 00:07:19.305
and validation

00:07:19.305 --> 00:07:20.840
and gives them a megaphone

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:22.675
to attract more viewers and

00:07:22.675 --> 00:07:23.743
and more supporters.

00:07:23.743 --> 00:07:25.144
And it just you know, the snowball

00:07:25.144 --> 00:07:26.512
continues running downhill.

00:07:26.512 --> 00:07:27.513
It's it's

00:07:27.513 --> 00:07:29.182
it's a very dangerous situation.

